{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Survivors: Defense</strong> is a pixel-style survival defense game where you must hold your ground against endless waves of incoming monsters. Choose your hero, collect skills, upgrade your power, and fight to survive in fast-paced, action-packed battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and auto-attacking gameplay, the focus is on strategy, positioning, and building your perfect skill combo. Each run offers a fresh experience thanks to random skill choices, item drops, and enemy patterns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Endless wave-based defense</strong>: Survive against increasingly challenging hordes of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Roguelike elements</strong>: No two runs are the same \u2014 adapt and experiment every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Multiple heroes and skills</strong>: Each hero comes with unique abilities and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Upgrade and combine</strong>: Collect both active and passive skills to create powerful synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Diverse enemies and epic bosses</strong>: Battle a wide variety of monsters with unique behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Variety of maps</strong>: Different environments and layouts with unique challenges.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878090?t=1759323327","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878090/a0acab1cf5359a3e1785835977651bc7c8f8e2f1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759323327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878090/4bebbeef84a1d2fcdd0